        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVPRO19ENTR, Keyed Provence Clear Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Provence Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset features a clear crystal egg knob that exudes traditional elegance. This Keyed Provence Clear Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is available in an array of stunning finishes. It is a single cylinder front door lock, meaning the door is opened by a thumb latch on the exterior and by a knob on the interior. On the deadbolt, there is a keyed lock cylinder for use on the outside of the door while a thumb turn is used to lock the door on the interior. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Entrance Set with Provence Crystal Knob will fit doors with a thickness range from 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch  or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/provence-crystal-knob-with-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favpro19\"><b>Provence Crystal Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Provence Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Provence Crystal Knob with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVPRO19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262395\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVPRO19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
